The witness guest for E7a (#1235, ADR 0123) — provenance, per ADR 0114's rule for committed guest binaries. Like
p3cat, it is reproducible from this repository plus the pinned toolchain: p3tcp/build.sh rebuilds it offline, and
builds its peer from echo/.

Source:       src/main.rs, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock (this directory). No dependencies and no WIT of its own: its
              imports are the ones Rust std and wasi-libc make for a wasm32-wasip3 program that is a TCP client.
